										"Events": [],
										"Text": {
											"$text": "# OSK-3 Account Register (excerpt)\r\n\r\n- **Guest**\r\n  - Username: Guest\r\n  - Password: accessUICS\r\n  - Note: Public bulletins. No write access.\r\n\r\n- **Quartermaster**\r\n  - Username: Quartermaster\r\n  - Password: Depot#Ring12\r\n  - Note: Logistics directory. Fuel, rations, vehicle maintenance.\r\n\r\n- **Admin**\r\n  - Username: Admin\r\n  - Note: Credential withheld from this register by order of Sector Command (Directive 12-C). Contact the duty quartermaster for the current rotation."
										}
