									{
										"$class": "/Game/Blueprints/MissionSystem/Objects/Terminal/Sequences/BP_TerminalSequence_Text.BP_TerminalSequence_Text_C",
										"Widget": "/Game/Blueprints/MissionSystem/UI/Terminal/Response/W_TerminalResponse_Text.W_TerminalResponse_Text_C",
										"Events": [],
										"Text": {
											"$text": "# CHECKPOINT BULLETIN – OUTSKIRTS CORDON\r\n\r\nEffective immediately:\r\n\r\n1. Curfew on the ring road runs 21:00–05:00. Civilian vehicles found inside the cordon after curfew are to be stopped and searched.\r\n2. Checkpoint Alpha (rail overpass) is reduced to one lane while the barrier is repaired. Expect queues.\r\n3. The water treatment plant is OFF LIMITS to all non-engineering personnel. Report any movement near the settling tanks.\r\n4. Abandoned vehicles on Kiln Street are NOT to be approached. Two were rigged last week.\r\n5. Ration distribution moves to the school gymnasium on Thursdays.\r\n\r\nStay sharp. The city is watching the cordon, and so is everyone else."
										}
									}
								]
							}
						}
					}
				]
