											"$text": "# VEHICLE & NODE MAINTENANCE LOG – OSK-3\r\n\r\n[02/11 06:40] Checkpoint Alpha barrier motor replaced. Hydraulics still leaking.\r\n[02/11 14:15] Patrol truck UICS-12-07 returned with a cracked radiator. Grounded.\r\n[03/11 09:02] Node OSK-3 rebooted after the power cut. Admin account reset by signals.\r\n              Temporary admin credential issued to the duty officer: Admin / UICS@Outskirts-7\r\n              REMINDER: rotate before the next inspection. (Still not rotated – QM)\r\n[04/11 18:30] Water plant generator running on its last filter. Parts at Water Plant Store.\r\n[05/11 07:55] Radio mast on the grain silo realigned. Signal to Sector Command restored."
