										"Text": {
											"$text": "# SECTOR COMMAND DIRECTIVE 12-C (COPY)\r\n\r\nThe Outskirts cordon is to be held at the ring road until relieved. Withdrawal from the residential blocks is NOT authorised.\r\n\r\nPatrol strength is raised to two squads per checkpoint during curfew. The rail yard is to be swept daily; any contact is reported directly to Sector Command, not over the open net.\r\n\r\nThe full perimeter plan is stored on this node. Do not print it, do not transmit it."
