						"Events": [],
						"Text": {
							"$text": "Available Commands:\r\n\r\n1. help (?) - Display available commands and their descriptions.\r\n2. dir (ls) - Display all of the files and folders in the current directory.\r\n3. cd <directory> - Change directory.\r\n4. pop (..) - Go back to the previous directory.\r\n5. login - Enter new login credentials to change the user & permissions.\r\n6. read <file_id> - Read the content of a file.\r\n7. run <file_id> - Execute a program.\r\n8. scan <file_id> - Scan a file for hidden or classified content.\r\n9. download <file_id> - Download a file to your device.\r\n10. shutdown (exit) - Shut down the terminal.\r\n\r\n**Additional help**\r\n\r\n> Use cd <directory> and dir to look around. Restricted directories need the right account or the right key.\r\n> The account register in sys lists who can log in. Not every credential is written down there."
						}
					}
